OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith a few showers spreading up from
OL,7,Fthe southwest. Some of these could be
OL,8,Fheavy, especially in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FShowers at first, heavy in
OL,11,Fplaces, but these dying out through
OL,12,Fthe evening. Remaining cloudy
OL,13,Fovernight with more showers moving
OL,14,Finto the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA cloudy morning with showers
OL,17,Fspreading east, some possibly heavy.
OL,18,FBecoming drier and brighter in the
OL,19,Fafternoon, then outbreaks of rain
OL,20,Freaching the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
